# Realistic Pitch Deck Complete

I have completely overhauled the PowerPoint presentation to use **REAL screenshots** directly from your locally running software, alongside custom Oil & Gas SVGs!

## What Was Done

1. **Automated Server Boot & Capture:** 
   I booted up your Flask backend and Vite frontend and wrote an automated script using Playwright to log into the software as `admin@sonatrach-demo.dz` and take high-resolution screenshots of the actual, live dashboards populated with your demo data.
2. **Oil & Gas SVGs:** 
   I generated custom, scalable vector graphics (SVGs) tailored for the Oil & Gas industry, using the Sonatrach Orange (`#FF6600`) color scheme. These include an Oil Drop, an Industrial Factory, and a Natural Gas Flame. The raw `.svg` files have been saved to your `server` directory so you can use them freely, and they were also embedded into the slides as decorations!
3. **Slide Expansion:**
   The presentation was expanded to cover:
   - The Main Dashboard (with real screenshot)
   - Methane Explorer (with real screenshot)
   - ISO 14064-1 Reports (with real screenshot)
   - Manage Data / Custom Factors (with real screenshot)
   - Mitigation Projects (with SVG factory decoration)

